              "Issue-report submission rejected by validation",
              "Interpretation"
            ],
            "line_start": 20,
            "line_end": 25
          }
        },
        "excerpt": "## Interpretation\n\nA validation rejection means that creation attempt did not create a report.\nA successful creation returns HTTP 201 with a report ID and `submitted` status.\nA customer remembering a click does not establish which response was returned.\n\n",
        "content_hash": "3bade303e6718721411e16010f86f012fa54ee36d1b8b85e383d70fd3c84a53d",
