              "Updating the affected service on an issue report",
              "Checks and behavior"
            ],
            "line_start": 10,
            "line_end": 16
          }
        },
        "excerpt": "## Checks and behavior\n\nOmitting `affected_service_code` from a PATCH leaves it unchanged. Supplying a\nknown service code changes the association; supplying null clears it. An unknown\nservice code returns HTTP 422. The customer update contract does not permit\nediting the description or status.\n\n",
        "content_hash": "468e6e76eff5403a789ef93933746a4bd30aa37e88a0d3bb5ca3c2c8c750182f",
        "metadata_hash": "c82d246750ae102ddf0f282a949df02681f3f9d4391852f268a158ed57eb30d4"
      },
